        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "NOTE 19 When the configurable mechanism as defined by [V2G20-2320] indicates that the curve as defined by [V2G20-2674] needs to be used, signature algorithm \"ecdsa_secp521r1_sha512\" is given preference. When the configurable mechanism as defined by [V2G20-2320] indicates that the curve as defined by [V2G20-2319] needs to be used, signature algorithm \"ed448\" is given preference.",
